# Live-uploaded call audio (demo Upload page) — genuinely ephemeral, not
# meant to be versioned. backend/sample_calls/*.wav is the fixed 6-call demo
# dataset and IS committed — the deploy has no other way to get it onto a
# fresh host's ephemeral disk (see README's "what's mocked" section).
uploads/
